  a. The numbers intermediate between the decades 20-100 are Dvandva compounds formed by prefixing the accented unit to the decade; e. g. aṣṭā-viṃśati 28; éka-triṃśat 31; tráyas-triṃśat 33; náva-catvāriṃśat 49; náva-ṣaṣṭi 69; návāśīti 89; páñca-navati 95, ṣáṇ-ṇavati 96, aṣṭā-navati 98; éka-śatam 101, cátuḥ-śatam 104, triṃśác-chatam 130\.
